## Local configuration
# appsettings.json is tracked — it now contains NO real secrets (only structure/defaults).
# Real credentials live in appsettings.Development.json and environment variables, both excluded below.

# *** Credential-bearing files — NEVER commit these ***
appsettings.Development.json
.env.api

# Environment files & certificates (still excluded)
.env
*.env
*.pfx
*.p12
*.key

